        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Empamo eyateeriirwe orubuga Taya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akangambira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wewe mwana w'omuntu, oterre Taya empamo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ogigambire oti: MUKAMA Ruhanga naagambira abantu abanyakuli ha ntaaho y'enyanja, abarukusuuburrana n'amahanga aga ha bizinga ebingi ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tarasiisi, yasuuburranaga na iwe, habw'obuguuda bwaawe obutagambwa kandi obwa buli mulingo; efeeza, ekyoma ibaati, n'isasi, nibyo baakuhaga, na iwe obaha ebintu ebyawe ebindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yavani, Tubbali na Meseki, nabo baasuuburranaga na iwe; bbo, baaleetaga abantu, n'ebintu eby'omulinga, nukwo obahe ebintu ebyawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Besitogarama, yo yaleetaga embaraasi, embaraasi ez'obulemu, n'enyumbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaija Rodesi nabo mwasuuburranaga; ebizinga bingi bikaba biri butale bwawe obumanyirwe; baakuleeteraga amasanga g'enjojo n'emifunjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edomu nayo, yasuuburranaga na iwe, habwokuba n'ebintu ebingi ebirukwingana aho, abo baakuleeteraga amabaale ag'omuhendo emerarudo, engoye eza kahuukya ezihunzirwe kitaani enungi, amabaale ag'omuhendo karoli n'agate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda n'ensi eya Isirairi, nazo zaasuuburranaga na iwe; ab'ensi ezi, baakuleeteraga engano, emizaituuni, emitini ekiri nto obwoki bw'enjoki, amagita ag'okulya, nag'okwihamu omubazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damasiko nayo, ekasuuburrana na iwe, habw'ebintu byawe ebingi biti, habw'itungo lyawe eritagambwa, erya buli mulingo; eviini eya Heribboni, ebyoya by'entaama ebirukwera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'eviini eyarugaga Uzali, ebi nibyo baa leetaga nukwo batwara ebintu byawe; ekyoma ekirukuguma muno, kasiya na karamo, nibyo baaleetaga nukwo batwara ebintu byawe eby'obusuubuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dedani, nayo ekasuuburrana na iwe, neereeta engoye ez'okuta ha ntebe, ezinyakwikalirwaho abatembi b'embaraasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arabbiya n'abalemi boona aba Kedara, bakaba bali basuubuzi bawe ab'ekitiinisa, abaaleetaga: ebyana by'entaama, entaama empaya n'embuzi; ebi nibyo baagurranaga na iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasuubuzi aba Sebba na Raama, nabo baasuuburranaga na iwe, abo baaleetaga ebintu ebirukirra kimu kuboya kurungi ebya buli mulingo, amabaale goona ag'omuhendo na zaabbu, nukwo batwara ebintu byawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Harani, Kane, Asihura, na Kirumaadi, ensi ezi zoona baasuuburranaga na iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo baasuuburranaga na iwe, nibaleeta ebyokujwara ebirungi muno, engoye eza bbururu kandi ez'amabara agacwerraine, n'ebirago ebinyakurukirwe omu bintu ebinyakuhindwirwe n'erangi, biboherwe n'emiguha bya aguma; ebi nibyo baasuuburranaga na iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.11+REV.18.12+REV.18.13+REV.18.14+REV.18.15+REV.18.16+REV.18.17+REV.18.18+REV.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kus 18:11-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emeeri eza Tarasiisi, zaayambukaga amayanja ziija kusuubura ebintu byawe, nukwo waikaire oti omu mayanja hagati, watunga watungurra, waba w'ekitiinisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
